# Fortessa Workspace Cursor Rules (Synced)

# Required Context (Read First)
- Before making changes, read and follow:
  - .cursor/rules/README.md
  - .cursor/rules/coding_standards.md
- If instructions conflict, prioritize:
  1) .cursorrules
  2) .cursor/rules/README.md and the referenced files
  3) repository codebase patterns

# Documentation Placement Policy
- NEVER create new markdown files under /docs in this repository.
- Durable docs (architecture, runbooks, ADR/RFC, integration guides) MUST be created in the fortessa-docs repository under fortessa-docs/docs/**.
- Ephemeral docs (debug notes, test plans, cursor plans, investigations, handoffs) MUST be created under /scratch/** in this repository.

# Cross-team docs
- If asked to create docs for another repo/team to review, default to /scratch/handoffs/.
- Cross-team handoffs MUST include:
  DELETE_OK: true
  EXPIRES_ON: YYYY-MM-DD
  OWNER_TEAM: <team>
  REVIEW_TEAM: <team>
  RELATED_PR: <link or placeholder>

# Thin docs rule
- Only docs/README.md is allowed in this repository's /docs folder.
- If a durable doc is needed, add a link in docs/README.md pointing to fortessa-docs.

# Output defaults
- When producing an implementation plan or analysis, write to:
  /scratch/cursor/YYYY-MM-DD_<topic>.md
